            "title": "Wall Street Breakfast: What Moved Markets This Week",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/attachment/image/219ce2e9e505d26ba97bb843a7c37b56.png?io=w640\" width=\"100%\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">Seeking Alpha</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"> </p> <p><span class=\"b italic\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/74-investment-news-quiz-friday-oct-23-2026-10-23\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> and see how you stack up against the competition.</span></p> <h2> </h2> <p>Wall Street closed the week mixed as a sharp spike in volatility reflected fresh tech struggles, while investors continued to digest hotter-than-expected CPI data and the latest bank earnings.<br/><br/>CPI inflation <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4652866-cpi-inflation-heats-up-in-september-in-line-with-expectations&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792873633688000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vGugUW1eo2kzt4EyG5Yu4\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4652866-cpi-inflation-heats-up-in-september-in-line-with-expectations\" target=\"_blank\">heated up</a> in September. On a year-over-year basis, the Consumer Price Index rose 3.7%, matching the consensus forecast and accelerating from a 3.4% gain in August.The Cboe Volatility Index (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/VIX\" title=\"S&amp;P VIX Index\">VIX</a>) surged roughly 30% on Friday afternoon to trade above 21, reaching a more than <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4653956-wall-street-fear-gauge-vix-surges-to-over-four-month-high&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792873633688000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0edKhR5gaIzDtmJV1B2Jc9\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4653956-wall-street-fear-gauge-vix-surges-to-over-four-month-high\" target=\"_blank\">four-month high</a> as tech stocks continued to struggle.<br/><br/>Big banks kicked off Q3 <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651821-watch-big-banks-capital-markets-commercial-banking-results-in-q3-earnings&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792873633688000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15hSiKIXqdgeCDtW3nBGGy\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651821-watch-big-banks-capital-markets-commercial-banking-results-in-q3-earnings\" target=\"_blank\">earnings</a> season as traders digested results from Goldman Sachs (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GS\" title=\"The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc.\">GS</a>), JPMorgan (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/JPM\" title=\"JPMorgan Chase &amp; Co.\">JPM</a>), Citigroup (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/C\" title=\"Citigroup Inc.\">C</a>), Wells Fargo (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WFC\" title=\"Wells Fargo &amp; Company\">WFC</a>), and other major lenders.<br/><br/>For the week, the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) added +0.67%, the benchmark S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) lost -1.95%, and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/C\" title=\"Citigroup Inc.\">C</a>OMP:IND) plunged -4.48%. Read a preview of next week's major events in Seeking Alpha's <a data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://seekingalpha.com/news/4653857-catalyst-watch-meta-earnings-kroger-event-and-black-monday-turns-39&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792873633688000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lFG2H7DVCp3kVY1sY7-s1\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4653857-catalyst-watch-meta-earnings-kroger-event-and-black-monday-turns-39\" target=\"_blank\">Catalyst Watch</a>.</p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4656492-how-will-the-el-nino-wrecking-ball-impact-the-global-economy\">'Wrecking ball'</a></h2> <p>The UN is sounding the alarm on this year's El Niño, with the agency's emergency relief chief Tom Fletcher describing it as \"a wrecking ball\" that will bring extreme heat, droughts and floods. While El Niño is a normal climate pattern, it's expected to be unprecedented this year. This year appears similar to the 1997-98 event that caused an estimated $5.7T in global income losses. <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4656492-how-will-the-el-nino-wrecking-ball-impact-the-global-economy\"><span class=\"b\">Read more.</span></a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</p> <p>Upgrading AppLovin (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/APP\" title=\"AppLovin Corporation\">APP</a>): Stock Has <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4956022-applovin-corporation-stock-has-fallen-too-far-upgrade\">Fallen Too Far</a>.<br/><br/>Papa John's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PZZA\" title=\"Papa John's International, Inc.\">PZZA</a>): Reset Paves Way <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4955593-papa-johns-this-painful-reset-could-set-the-stage-for-recovery-rating-upgrade\">For Recovery</a>.<br/><br/>Patient Traders <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4956036-winnebago-weak-q4-results-but-patient-investors-can-start-buying-upgrade\">Can Start Buying</a> Winnebago (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WGO\" title=\"Winnebago Industries, Inc.\">WGO</a>).<br/><br/><a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CII\">CII's</a> Distribution Is Likely Covered <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4955845-cii-the-distribution-is-likely-covered-through-2027-rating-upgrade\">Through 2027</a>.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RWTQ\" title=\"Redwood Trust, Inc. CAL 30\">RWTQ</a> Is Priced For Default, It's <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4955839-rwtq-priced-for-default-time-to-buy-rating-upgrade\">Time To Buy</a>.<br/><br/>Netflix (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NFLX\" title=\"Netflix, Inc.\">NFLX</a>): I Was So Wrong, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4955826-netflix-q3-i-was-so-wrong-i-want-to-cry-rating-downgrade\">I Want To Cry</a>.<br/><br/>Realty Income (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/O\" title=\"Realty Income Corporation\">O</a>) May Be In Trouble, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4955134-realty-income-could-be-in-trouble-rating-downgrade\">I'm Holding</a>.<br/><br/>Red Cat's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RCAT\" title=\"Red Cat Holdings, Inc.\">RCAT</a>) Steyr Deal Raises <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4955796-red-cat-steyr-acquisition-raises-dilution-risk-rating-downgrade\">Dilution Risk</a>.<br/><br/>AeroVironment (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AVAV\" title=\"AeroVironment, Inc.\">AVAV</a>) Still Overvalued: <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4956591-aerovironment-is-still-overvalued-its-a-sell\">It's A 'Sell.'</a><br/><br/>Wynn Resorts (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WYNN\" title=\"Wynn Resorts, Limited\">WYNN</a>): Macau <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4956294-wynn-resorts-downgrade-to-sell-as-macau-weakness-extends-into-q4-26\">Weakness Persists</a>.</p> <h2> </h2> <p><span><strong>U.S. Indices</strong><br/>Dow +0.4% to 52,215. S&amp;P 500 -0.5% to 7,624. Nasdaq -0.7% to 25,955. Russell 2000 +2% to 2,776. CBOE Volatility Index -2.7% to 19.45. <br/><br/><strong>S&amp;P 500 Sectors</strong><br/>Consumer Staples +0.5%. Utilities +0.8%. Financials +0.7%. Telecom -6.2%. Healthcare +1.5%. Industrials -1.9%. Information Technology -0.3%. Materials -0.1%. Energy +1.6%. Consumer Discretionary +0.5%. Real Estate +1.1%. <br/><br/><strong>World Indices</strong><br/>London -1.8% to 10,690. France -2.2% to 7,783. Germany -1.7% to 25,182. Japan -4% to 62,693. China -0.7% to 3,690. Hong Kong -4.5% to 23,093. India -2.2% to 73,124. <br/><br/><strong>Commodities and Bonds</strong><br/>Crude Oil WTI +4.5% to $103.44/bbl. Gold -4.1% to $4,010./oz. Natural Gas <span>-15.6%</span> to 2.63. Ten-Year Bond Yield -0.2 bps to 4.988. <br/><br/><strong>Forex and Cryptos</strong><br/>EUR/USD -0.33%. USD/JPY -0.74%. GBP/USD +0.36%. Bitcoin -0.8%. Litecoin -2.7%. Ethereum -0.8%. XRP -0.1%. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Gainers</strong><br/>Hashbro (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/HAS\" title=\"Hasbro, Inc.\">HAS</a>) +19%. Charles River Laboratories (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CRL\" title=\"Charles River Laboratories International, Inc.\">CRL</a>) +15%. Roper Technologies (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ROP\" title=\"Roper Technologies, Inc.\">ROP</a>) +14%. Allegion (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ALLE\" title=\"Allegion plc\">ALLE</a>) +14%. CrowdStrike Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CRWD\" title=\"CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc.\">CRWD</a>) +13%. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Losers</strong><br/>Comfort Systems USA (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FIX\" title=\"Comfort Systems USA, Inc.\">FIX</a>) -19%. Howmet Aerospace (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/HWM\" title=\"Howmet Aerospace Inc.\">HWM</a>) -16%. Flex (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FLEX\" title=\"Flex Ltd.\">FL